ding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online na plataforma Acorrer em https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/1-sao-silvestre-da-moita e o regulamento oficial integral em PDF pode ser consultado nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"I S\u00e3o Silvestre da Moita 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Rua D. Manuel I (junto aos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios), Moita\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Moita\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Grupo Pegada Ribeirinha\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a I S\u00e3o Silvestre da Moita 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A I S\u00e3o Silvestre da Moita 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 21 de Novembro de 2026, com partida e meta na Rua D. Manuel I (junto ao quartel dos bombeiros volunt\u00e1rios), na Moita.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra a Corrida Kids de 500m \u00e0s 17:00, a Corrid